Package: AACclust
Type: Package
Title: Affinity Contraction Agglomerative Clustering for Categorical Data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tarik", "Faouzi", email = "tarik.faouzi@usach.cl", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ruben", "Carvajal Schiaffino", email = "ruben.carvajal@usach.cl", role = "aut"))
Description: Implements the Affinity Contraction Agglomerative Clustering (AAC) 
    algorithm for categorical data, along with the Quality Index (QI) for 
    partition quality assessment. The AAC algorithm operates on exact attribute 
    matching and mutual affinity edge contractions, avoiding dependency on 
    initial medoids. A parallel optimization framework (Fork-Join model) 
    efficiently searches for the optimal number of clusters.
